From: Tetris port maintainers
Subject: [STAGING PATCH] regulator: MT6363 native modem rails

Add source-backed VBUCK1/2 and VSRAM_MODEM to the exact packaged
minimal provider. Existing connectivity blocks remain byte-identical.
New children must be available to register; metadata remains disabled
and is not included by any shipping DT. Preserve inherited control
banks and enable requests. Main selector readback is not DA voltage.
Shared-key FCCM changes, voter takeover and set_load stay unsupported.

